    "pointer": "/classes/monk/7/desc",
    "source": "A monk who summons their own spirit outward as glowing arms, a watching visage and a full body.",
    "sourceHash": "cbd26ad4f32d99e6e606c14de768448386d85db9b3183d36cb43cea619a0484d"
  },
  {
    "id": "111060090c85588f5aed",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/monk/7/levels/3/0/n",
    "source": "Arms of the Astral Self",
    "sourceHash": "c6e5071fe523e9a455a129f7073dd827ffc1b666bf2967fe92a7547ca74efef8"
  },
  {
    "id": "0178b3cb6d090780cf97",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/monk/7/levels/3/0/d",
    "source": "As a bonus action, spend 1 ki to summon spectral arms for 10 minutes; when they appear, each creature of your choice you can see within 10 feet makes a Dexterity save or takes force damage equal to two rolls of your martial arts die. While they last you can use Wisdom for Strength checks and saves, your unarmed strikes reach 5 feet farther, and those strikes can use Wisdom for attack and damage rolls and deal force damage.",
    "sourceHash": "8a3b4fea6305017bbeb954ca8267764804ce646ae3a7252055114348ed9ed40c"
  },
  {
    "id": "2de5d23a54e47332aef5",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/monk/7/levels/6/0/n",
    "source": "Visage of the Astral Self",
    "sourceHash": "fd4f82242008359e16212fc70ee117653d52f6fdafcb03dff0c1fc68ac56feba"
  },
  {
    "id": "b3a10e44a512f96ada9b",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/monk/7/levels/6/0/d",
    "source": "As a bonus action, spend 1 ki to summon a spectral visage for 10 minutes: Astral Sight (you see normally in darkness, magical or not, to 120 feet), Wisdom of the Spirit (advantage on Insight and Intimidation checks) and Word of the Spirit (you speak to only one creature within 60 feet, or project your voice up to 600 feet).",
    "sourceHash": "5fd51ae1b2bc79d592cc2b20a4783d450c6b573174d12aeaf4dcd58e1b4f50b2"
  },
  {
    "id": "6c3b327e70dea0cd8569",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/monk/7/levels/11/0/n",
    "source": "Body of the Astral Self",
    "sourceHash": "9aff8f30de797c9076c9c3edd06629b6a82b9511a157aa27002d06fb63ab9c42"
  },
